@anon.056909d58185468a4c5e660ab0f52ad7.671 = private unnamed_addr constant <{ [953 x i8] }> <{ [953 x i8] c"Actions have a cost, so only include actions that you think\0Awill be helpful to you in doing a great job answering the\0Aprompt in the future.\0A\0AYou must respond ONLY with a list of actions you would like to\0Aperform. Each action should be on its own line, and followed by a space and then its parameter.\0A\0AActions can be performed more than once with different parameters.\0AHere is an example valid response:\0A\0A```\0Afile path/to/my/file.txt\0Afile path/to/another/file.txt\0Asearch something to search for\0Asearch something else to search for\0A```\0A\0AOnce again, do not forget: you must respond ONLY in the format of\0Aone action per line, and the action name should be followed by\0Aits parameter. Your response must not include anything other\0Athan a list of actions, with one action per line, in this format.\0AIt is extremely important that you do not deviate from this format even slightly!\0A\0AThis is the end of my instructions for how to respond. The rest is the prompt:\0A" }>, align 1
